00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:28.540
And I also lead back-end
development for our games

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:29.040
team--

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:29.840
MARK MANDEL: Oh, cool.

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:31.660
JP ROBINSON: --so for the
crossword and all the fun Toys

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.560
MARK MANDEL: Yeah, we used that
as a cool thing of the week

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.510
not that long ago,
when you announced--

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:39.450
